<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: anti-torpedo torpedo -->
  <DepthRim_AntiTorpedo.label>反魚雷魚雷</DepthRim_AntiTorpedo.label>
  <!-- EN: A short, fast interceptor torpedo. Loaded into a torpedo tube, it is fired automatically by a fire-control sonar at torpedoes heading for this map. It only engages torpedoes. -->
  <DepthRim_AntiTorpedo.description>短而快的攔截魚雷。裝進魚雷發射管後，火控聲納會自動把它射向朝這張地圖來的魚雷。只打魚雷。</DepthRim_AntiTorpedo.description>
  
  <!-- EN: supercavitating point-defence gun -->
  <DepthRim_SupercavitatingGun.label>超空泡近防砲</DepthRim_SupercavitatingGun.label>
  <!-- EN: A rapid-fire gun whose darts ride in a bubble of vapour, so they keep their speed underwater. It fires on its own at torpedoes in the last moments before they arrive, as long as a sonar on this map can hear them. Each burst has a fair chance of destroying the torpedo.\n\nRequires power and steel darts. Does not need fire control. -->
  <DepthRim_SupercavitatingGun.description>速射砲，彈鏢包在一層蒸氣泡裡，在水中也不減速。魚雷快抵達的最後一段，只要這張地圖上有聲納聽得到，它就會自己開火；每輪射擊都有不小的機會擊毀魚雷。\n\n需要電力與鋼製彈鏢。不需要火控。</DepthRim_SupercavitatingGun.description>
