  <!-- EN: torpedo -->
  <DepthRim_Torpedo.label>魚雷</DepthRim_Torpedo.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavyweight torpedo, loaded into a torpedo tube and fired at targets beyond the map. It only travels by sea. Its warhead, guidance and payload can be swapped in the assembly tab. -->
  <DepthRim_Torpedo.description>重型魚雷，裝進魚雷發射管後射向地圖外的目標。只能走海路。戰鬥部、導引與酬載可以在裝配分頁更換。</DepthRim_Torpedo.description>
  
  <!-- EN: torpedo tube -->
  <DepthRim_TorpedoTube.label>魚雷發射管</DepthRim_TorpedoTube.label>
  <!-- EN: A pair of pressure-rated tubes that hold two torpedoes and fire them at targets beyond the map. Torpedoes only travel by sea, so the target must be reachable by water. Anti-torpedo torpedoes loaded here are fired by a fire-control sonar at incoming torpedoes.\n\nRequires power. -->
  <DepthRim_TorpedoTube.description>一對耐壓發射管，可裝兩枚魚雷，射向地圖外的目標。魚雷只能走海路，所以目標要從海上到得了。裝在這裡的反魚雷魚雷，會由火控聲納射向來襲的魚雷。\n\n需要電力。</DepthRim_TorpedoTube.description>
  
</LanguageData>